1209	1348	Personal life
Bonino never married nor had children, even surrendering to the Italian authorities in 1975 after having an illegal abortion.
1349	1372	She fostered children.

1372	1475	She graduated from Bocconi University in literature with a master thesis on Malcolm X's autobiography.

